@startuml
title Sequence: Grant and Revoke Access (on-chain ACL)

actor Admin
actor "Revoked Account" as Revoked
participant "Secrets UI\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "Secrets API\n:8080" as API
participant "SecretsAcl\nContract" as Contract
participant "Audit Writer" as Audit

== Grant access ==
Admin -> UI: Grant read/write to account
UI -> API: POST /secrets/{id}/acl\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\n{ account, canRead, canWrite }
API -> Contract: grantAccess(secretId, account, canRead, canWrite)
Contract --> API: AccessGranted event
API -> Audit: emit GRANT event
Audit -> Contract: auditEvent(secretId, account, GRANT, hash)
API --> UI: 200 OK

== Revoke access ==
Admin -> UI: Revoke access from account
UI -> API: DELETE /secrets/{id}/acl/{account}\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
API -> Contract: revokeAccess(secretId, account)
Contract --> API: AccessRevoked event
API -> Audit: emit REVOKE event
Audit -> Contract: auditEvent(secretId, account, REVOKE, hash)
API --> UI: 200 OK

== Later read attempt is rejected ==
Revoked -> API: GET /secrets/{id}\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
API -> Contract: canRead(secretId, revokedAccount)
Contract --> API: false
API --> Revoked: 403 Forbidden

@enduml
